        "type": "base",
        "description": "<p>Until the start of your next turn, the area gains the following effects:</p><ul><li><p>Once as a free maneuver at the start of your turn, you allow yourself and each ally in the area to spend any number of Recoveries.</p></li><li><p>The area is difficult terrain for enemies.</p></li><li><p>Each enemy who enters the area for the first time in a combat round or starts their turn there takes [[/damage @R]]{damage} equal to your Reason score.</p></li></ul>",
